{"_comment": "The share of certified H-1B filings promising less than the median wage for their occupation, measured twice: against the NATIONAL median and against the median for that occupation IN THE WORKSITE STATE. Built because filings concentrate in high-wage states, so a national yardstick can flatter them -- a wage clearing the national median may still sit below the local one. STATE, NOT METRO: OEWS publishes metropolitan areas and they would be sharper, but the application records a worksite state reliably and a metro only by city and postcode, which needs a crosswalk that introduces its own errors. Filings whose occupation has no published median in their state are counted as unmatched rather than assigned the national figure. This is what was PROMISED, not paid, and filing at a low level is lawful.", "sources": {"wages": "BLS OEWS state file, 2024", "filings": "US DOL OFLC, H-1B LCA disclosure data, FY2019 and FY2023"}, "oews_year": 2024, "filings_priced": 565966, "unmatched_state_occupation": 60558, "below_national_median_pct": 70.8, "below_local_median_pct": 78.7, "by_level": {"Level I": {"priced": 91298, "below_national_pct": 99.3, "below_local_pct": 99.8}, "Level II": {"priced": 250523, "below_national_pct": 89.1, "below_local_pct": 97.9}, "Level III": {"priced": 127886, "below_national_pct": 53.1, "below_local_pct": 72.9}, "Level IV": {"priced": 96259, "below_national_pct": 19.6, "below_local_pct": 16.5}}, "by_state": [{"state": "CA", "priced": 103494, "below_local_pct": 70.3, "below_national_pct": 37.7, "difference_pts": 32.6}, {"state": "TX", "priced": 84796, "below_local_pct": 79.1, "below_national_pct": 81.7, "difference_pts": -2.6}, {"state": "NY", "priced": 42075, "below_local_pct": 77.2, "below_national_pct": 56.0, "difference_pts": 21.2}, {"state": "WA", "priced": 34702, "below_local_pct": 84.3, "below_national_pct": 57.2, "difference_pts": 27.1}, {"state": "NJ", "priced": 32165, "below_local_pct": 74.7, "below_national_pct": 66.5, "differenc